    "text": "Who are literary heroes of mine?\n\nGeorge Borrow\nFernando Pessoa\nMiguel de Cervantes\nJorge Luís Borges\nV. S. Naipaul\nRyszard Kapuściński\nJosep Pla\nJoseph Conrad\nNassim Nicholas Taleb (probably the only one alive, and I am happy I could meet him)",
