    "text": "My 40 books of 2022 rated:\n\n1. The new map: energy, climate, and the clash of nations (97%)\n2. An Austrian Perspective on the History of Economic Thought (96%)\n3. Quality Investing (95%)\n4. Buffett: the making of an American capitalist (95%) https://t.co/1hiq1xhexn",
