    "text": "I use the tetragram for waiting (𝌗) to mark TODOs which are paused, waiting for something.\n\nAs bonus point, it resembles a sketch of the construction of the Cantor set (a topological rarity defined as the limit of a recursive procedure), which brings good memories.",
