    "text": "Inspired by @tommycollison, I've embarked on a 5+ year project to read The Great Books at a breakneck (averaged) pace of 1 per week. \n\nMy list of books and the order I'm tackling them in, and more on the inspiration for this project, is here:\n\nhttps://t.co/h4LxxWAi27",
