    "text": "A book that I anticipate being added to the list soon is, surprisingly, David Hackett Fisher's *Albion's Seed.* I'm only a short way in, but I feel I've already learned an astonishing amount. Early interesting notes: 1/ https://t.co/XbJkpaGh1S https://t.co/KyM6nDfRoQ",
