    "text": "Happy New Year 2020!\n\n@Naval Ravikant is smart, insightful, pithy, eloquent. He makes me think, especially as I pursue a life of purpose and liberation.\n\nTwitter: @naval\nPodcast: Naval podcast at https://t.co/mM7zo4uC0Z\n\nHis monster 3-hour podcast is well worth your time.",
