    "text": "Sources of new ideas:\n\n- Extended conversations with others\n- Reading broadly (new fields)\n- Detailed (in the weeds) knowledge\n- Time away from the computer\n- Things that divide people\n- Talking with relatively new people to a craft\n- Traveling\n- Old ideas/books\n\nWhat about you?",
