    "text": "🔥 Don't be afraid to \"think outside the database\" — your UI doesn't need to map one-to-one with your data's fields and values.\n\nHere are a few ideas you can use to present \"field: value\" data in a more interesting way: https://t.co/NoL3wMtjLV",
