    "text": "Zones are not discrete, but represent a continuum. There are environmental reasons for such a distribution.\n\nNote: My representation of the Lognormal is a toy model; the true shape and the proportion zones may be different based on calibration and fitness... https://t.co/o7rNuDtWhC https://t.co/g5lfPTSsDk",
