    "text": "What people think are winning backgrounds:\n\n- Ivy League grad\n- good grades \n- comp sci/business major\n- after school activities \n\nActual winning backgrounds:\n\n- competitive ranked gamers\n- math/physics majors \n- flipping stuff on eBay\n- door to door sales / Mormon\n- debate champ",
